# 🎯 3-Phase Flow - Complete Integration Summary

## Critical Understanding

**Accessibility Tree ≠ Full Discovery**

- **Accessibility tree** (Playwright): Structured understanding of *current page*
- **Full discovery** (browser-use): Multi-page exploration + element finding + planning

This is why we need **both tools working together** in a 3-phase flow.

---

## 🔄 The 3-Phase Flow (Official Pattern)

```
USER TASK: "Add iPhone to cart on apple.com"
    ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ PHASE 1: DISCOVERY (browser-use MCP)                   │
│ Cost: $0.05 | Time: 5-10s | Cache: Miss only           │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                         │
│ 1. Navigate to apple.com                               │
│    └─> browser_use.browser_navigate(url)              │
│                                                         │
│ 2. Get page state (interactive elements)               │
│    └─> browser_use.browser_get_state()                │
│    Returns:                                            │
│    [                                                   │
│      {type: 'input', name: 'search', selector: '...'},│
│      {type: 'button', text: 'Add to Cart', ...},     │
│      {type: 'link', text: 'iPhone 15', ...}          │
│    ]                                                   │
│                                                         │
│ 3. Propose selectors based on task                     │
│    Task contains "Add" → Find button with "Add"        │
│    Proposed: button[aria-label="Add to Cart"]          │
│                                                         │
│ Output: Interactive elements list + proposed selectors │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
    ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ PHASE 2: VALIDATION (Playwright MCP + testing cap)     │
│ Cost: $0.02 | Time: 2-3s | Cache: Miss only            │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                         │
│ 1. Navigate with Playwright                            │
│    └─> playwright.browser_navigate(url)               │
│                                                         │
│ 2. Test proposed selector                              │
│    └─> playwright.get_element(proposed_selector)      │
│    └─> If found: element_ref = "xyz123"               │
│                                                         │
│ 3. Generate STABLE locator (testing cap!)              │
│    └─> playwright.browser_generate_locator(ref)       │
│    Returns: 'role=button[name="Add to Cart"]'          │
│    ↑ This is MORE STABLE than CSS!                     │
│                                                         │
│ 4. Validate 3x (success rate check)                    │
│    Run 1: ✅ Success                                    │
│    Run 2: ✅ Success                                    │
│    Run 3: ✅ Success                                    │
│    Success Rate: 100% (≥66% needed)                    │
│                                                         │
│ 5. Cache the stable locator                            │
│    Key: "pattern:apple.com:add"                        │
│    Value: {                                            │
│      steps: [                                          │
│        {                                               │
│          action: 'click',                              │
│          locator: 'role=button[name="Add to Cart"]'   │
│        }                                               │
│      ],                                                │
│      success_rate: 1.0,                                │
│      validated_at: "2025-01-20T..."                   │
│    }                                                   │
│    TTL: 7 days                                         │
│                                                         │
│ Output: Validated pattern with stable locators         │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
    ↓
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ PHASE 3: EXECUTION (Playwright MCP, cached)            │
│ Cost: $0.025 | Time: 2-5s | Cache: Hit always          │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                                                         │
│ 1. Load cached pattern                                 │
│    cache.get("pattern:apple.com:add")                  │
│    └─> Found! Use cached stable locator                │
│                                                         │
│ 2. Execute with Playwright (fast!)                     │
│    └─> playwright.browser_navigate(url)               │
│    └─> playwright.browser_click(                      │
│          'role=button[name="Add to Cart"]'            │
│        )                                               │
│                                                         │
│ 3. No LLM needed!                                      │
│    No discovery!                                       │
│    No validation!                                      │
│    Just execute cached steps!                          │
│                                                         │
│ Output: Task completed (6x cheaper)                     │
