## 🎯 When Each Phase Runs

### Phase 1: Discovery (browser-use)
**Triggers:**
- ✅ Cache miss (no known pattern)
- ✅ Cache expired (>7 days old)
- ✅ Cache invalidated (manual reset)
- ✅ Pattern failed validation (<66% success)

**Frequency:** ~50% of tasks initially, drops to ~10% at steady state

### Phase 2: Validation (Playwright + testing)
**Triggers:**
- ✅ After successful discovery
- ✅ Before caching new pattern
- ✅ When pattern needs refresh

**Frequency:** Same as Phase 1

### Phase 3: Execution (Playwright cached)
**Triggers:**
- ✅ Cache hit (most common!)
- ✅ Pattern already validated

**Frequency:** ~90% at steady state (target 50% minimum)

