## 🔧 Failure Recovery Integration

```python
try:
    # PHASE 3: Try cached execution
    result = await execute_phase3_cached(pattern)
    
except SelectorNotFoundError:
    # Selector broke! Re-discover
    
    # PHASE 1: Discovery (browser-use)
    discovery = await execute_phase1_discovery(task, url)
    
    if discovery['success']:
        # PHASE 2: Validate new selectors
        validation = await execute_phase2_validation(
            discovery['selectors'],
            url
        )
        
        if validation['success']:
            # Update cache with new pattern
            await cache.promote_to_cache(
                cache_key,
                validation['pattern'],
                validation['success_rate']
            )
            result = validation
        else:
            # Last resort: browser-use autonomous
            result = await browser_use.retry_with_browser_use_agent(task)
    else:
        # Vision fallback
        result = await vision_fallback.handle_selector_failure(...)

except Exception as e:
    # Other failures → existing recovery logic
    result = await failure_recovery.recover(context)
```

